# S01 shooting script — BEFORE

Exploratory production breakdown; source timing locked, new staging proposals reviewable. 1280×720, 24 fps. 15 shots / 3,024 frames / 2:06, absolute body range [216,3240). No year caption.

Screen-direction proposal: escape travels screen-left to screen-right in lateral coverage; bank pursuit stays behind/screen-left. This is a layout proposal, not established canon. POV shots must maintain the river axis. No facial likeness is canon-approved by this document.

